OL,3,GNEWSACar park bridges set for
OL,4,Ademolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPedestrian bridges that have been used
OL,7,Fby millions of shoppers over five
OL,8,Fdecades are set to be demolished.
OL,10,FThe High Street Multi-Storey Car Park
OL,11,Fin Bracknell, Berkshire, was built in
OL,12,Fthe 1970s to accommodate demand from
OL,13,Fpeople using the town centre.
OL,15,FPreparations are being made for it to
OL,16,Fbe demolished to make way for more than
OL,17,F140 apartments.
OL,19,FThe other bridge is located near the
OL,20,Fformer Bentalls department store, which
OL,21,Fclosed in September 2017 and was
OL,22,Fcompletely demolished in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
